<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port on January 6:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Liquid ammonia    3,600 (ULD)  1,200   MT Excel	  05/01</p>
<p> Timber		  673 (ULD)  3,837   MT Irufa	  04/01</p>
<p> Urea		    323 (ULD)    764   MV Pratishta    10/12</p>
<p> Granite		 957 (LDD)    687   Madras Express  31/12</p>
<p>Iron Ore</p>
<p>  concentrate     42,000 (LDD)    ---   Iran Ghazi	05/01</p>
<p> Benzene	     3,500 (LDD)    ---   Bow Gerd	  06/01</p>
<p> Fuel Oil	    8,000 (LDD)    ---   Nand Prakrati   06/01</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-Loading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Mangalore)</p>
